1 NAME R. Paku / Jaka Samudra Sunan Giri-1 (1481–1506)
2 GIVN R. Paku / Jaka Samudra Sunan Giri-1 (1481–1506)
2 NICK محمد عين اليقين
2 NICK Raden Paku
2 NICK Prabu Satmata
2 NICK Sultan Abdul Faqih
2 NICK Raden 'Ainul Yaqin
2 NICK Joko Samudra
2 NICK Muhammad Ainul Yakin
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Bukit Giri
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gresik
3 STAE Jawa Timur
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 BIRT
