2 NICK Sunan Prabu Amangkurat Agung
2 NICK SunanTegal Wangi
2 NICK (Susuhunan Amangkurat Tegalwangi) (1645-1677)
1 NAME R. Mas Sayidin Amangkurat I (Agung) 1646-1677
2 GIVN R. Mas Sayidin Amangkurat I (Agung) 1646-1677
2 SURN
1 SEX M
